- `POST /api/dashboard/save-suggestion`
- `POST /api/dashboard/update-settings`
- Stripe:
  - `POST /api/dashboard/upgrade-plan`
  - `POST /api/dashboard/stripe-connect`
  - `POST /api/dashboard/stripe-verify`
  - `POST /api/dashboard/payment-verify`

